---
import { ArrowLeft, ChartNoAxesCombined, Download, ExternalLink, Info, RefreshCw, Save } from '@lucide/astro';
const metrics=[['track_view','歌曲访问次数','页内有效访问记录'],['preview_start','试听开始','每次试听播放'],['preview_qualified','有效试听','前台实际 10 秒或自然结束'],['platform_click','平台跳转点击','重复点击单独计次'],['clip_start','视频开始','站内短视频播放'],['clip_complete','视频播完','自然结束确认'],['game_launch_request','游戏启动请求','点击进入游戏'],['game_ready','游戏就绪','运行端回报后才计入'],['save_success','本机存档确认','本机写入后回读成功'],['full_audio_start','完整播放开始','沿用原有播放权限']];
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hans"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive"/><title>推广报表 · Station Cat</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/admin-music.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/admin-station-content.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/admin-station-reports.css"/></head><body class="music-admin">
<header class="music-topbar"><a href="/admin/music/content/"><ArrowLeft size={17}/>返回内容工作区</a><a href="/admin/music/">音乐工作区</a><span>Station Cat / 后台</span></header>
<main class="music-shell station-content-shell report-shell">
<div class="music-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PROMOTION REPORTS</p><h1>看看作品，如何被听见。</h1><p class="muted">从歌曲访问到平台跳转，让每一份数据都有明确的口径。</p></div><span class="badge" id="report-role">核对管理员中</span></div>
<div class="music-feedback"><p id="report-status" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在核对报表权限与资料…</p><button id="report-reload" type="button" aria-label="重新核对报表工作区"><RefreshCw size={18}/></button></div>
<aside id="report-recovery" class="notice content-recovery" hidden><div><strong>上一次操作还没有确认。</strong><p>保留原操作编号，核对后再登记新数据。</p></div><button id="report-retry" type="button"><RefreshCw size={16}/>核对原操作</button></aside>
<form id="report-filter" class="music-panel report-filter" aria-label="筛选推广报表"><fieldset id="report-filter-fields" disabled>
<div class="workspace-heading"><h2>查看一段时间</h2><div class="report-periods" aria-label="快捷时间窗"><button type="button" data-days="7">7 天</button><button type="button" data-days="14" aria-pressed="true">14 天</button><button type="button" data-days="30">30 天</button></div></div>
<div class="report-fields"><label>开始日期（UTC）<input id="report-from" type="date" required/></label><label>结束日期（不含当日）<input id="report-to" type="date" required/></label><label>歌曲<select id="report-track"><option value="">全部歌曲</option></select></label><label>渠道<select id="report-source"><option value="">全部渠道</option></select></label><label>Campaign<select id="report-campaign"><option value="">全部 Campaign</option></select></label><label>短视频 / 素材<select id="report-clip"><option value="">全部素材</option></select></label><label>跳转平台<select id="report-provider"><option value="">全部平台</option><option value="netease">网易云音乐</option><option value="qishui">汽水音乐</option><option value="apple_music">Apple Music</option><option value="spotify">Spotify</option><option value="youtube">YouTube</option></select></label><button type="submit" class="primary report-query"><ChartNoAxesCombined size={17}/>查看报表</button></div>
<p class="muted report-scope">日期采用 UTC，左含右不含，最多 31 天。平台筛选仅限定跳转点击，访问与试听仍使用所选歌曲和渠道的会话口径。</p></fieldset></form>
<section id="report-result" hidden aria-label="站内统计结果">
<div class="workspace-heading report-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ON THIS SITE</p><h2>站内行为</h2></div><p id="report-window" class="muted"></p></div>
<div class="report-metrics">{metrics.map(([key,label,note],i)=><article class:list={['music-panel','report-metric',{'report-metric-primary':i<4}]}><h3>{label}</h3><p class="report-value" data-metric={key}>暂无数据</p><p class="muted">{note}</p></article>)}</div>
<div class="report-rates"><article class="music-panel"><h3>访问 → 试听开始</h3><p id="report-preview-rate" class="report-rate">暂无数据</p><p id="report-preview-denominator" class="muted"></p></article><article class="music-panel"><h3>访问 → 平台跳转</h3><p id="report-platform-rate" class="report-rate">暂无数据</p><p id="report-platform-denominator" class="muted"></p></article></div>
<p id="report-quality" class="notice"></p>
<details class="music-panel report-definition"><summary><Info size={17}/>统计口径与留存</summary><p>会话不是唯一访客。同一时间窗内，每个“会话 + 歌曲”只计一次访问会话；有多个平台点击也只计一次跳转会话。不同歌曲分别计入，分母始终来自所选范围内的歌曲访问记录。</p><p>试听开始与平台点击须关联同一会话、同一歌曲、同一筛选范围内的在先访问，间隔小于 30 分钟。未关联事件仍计入次数，相应转化率显示暂无数据。暂停、拖动、隐藏时间不计入 10 秒有效试听。</p><p>统计使用服务端接收时间，仅覆盖同意统计且采集成功的记录。原始事件留存 90 天，报表聚合最长 12 个日历月；留存任务异常会显示健康状态。跨日历史会话不能简单相加，无完整关联时不计算总转化率。</p><p>游戏就绪依赖运行端确认，本机存档确认不代表云端同步。平台跳转点击不等于平台播放。</p></details>
<section id="report-daily" class="music-panel" hidden><h3>历史每日核对</h3><p class="muted">每日会话率单独展示，不相加为整个时间窗的转化率。</p><div class="report-table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="历史每日统计" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>UTC 日期</th><th>访问次数</th><th>点击次数</th><th>试听开始率</th><th>平台跳转率</th></tr></thead><tbody id="report-daily-rows"></tbody></table></div></section>
<div class="report-snapshot"><button id="report-save-snapshot" type="button" disabled><Save size={17}/>保留此时间窗的精确聚合</button><p class="muted">仅保存已结束且原始记录仍完整的时间窗。保留统计结果，不保留访客会话编号。</p></div>
</section>
<section id="report-external" hidden aria-labelledby="report-external-title"><div class="workspace-heading report-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM THE PLATFORMS</p><h2 id="report-external-title">平台提供的数据</h2></div><span class="badge">独立来源</span></div><p class="muted">人工登记的平台曝光和播放量，逐条保留来源、统计时间窗与更新时间。不自动合并，不用站内点击推算播放量或精确转化率。</p><div id="report-external-records" class="report-external-list"></div></section>
<details id="report-import" class="music-panel report-import" hidden><summary><Download size={17}/>登记或修订平台数据</summary><form id="report-external-form"><fieldset id="report-import-fields" disabled><p id="report-edit-note" class="muted">请使用平台认可的数据；没有来源的数据保持暂无数据。</p><div class="report-fields"><label>所属歌曲<select id="external-track" required><option value="">请选择所属歌曲</option></select></label><label>指标<select id="external-metric"><option value="impressions">平台曝光量</option><option value="platform_plays">平台播放量</option></select></label><label>平台<select id="external-provider"></select></label><label>数值（有来源的 0 可登记）<input id="external-value" type="number" min="0" max="2147483647" step="1" required/></label><label>Campaign（可选）<select id="external-campaign"><option value="">不限定</option></select></label><label>短视频 / 素材（可选）<select id="external-clip"><option value="">不限定</option></select></label><label>来源形式<select id="external-source-kind"><option value="platform_dashboard">平台后台</option><option value="platform_export">平台导出报表</option></select></label><label>记录状态<select id="external-status"><option value="active">有效</option><option value="withdrawn">已撤回</option></select></label><label>开始时间（UTC）<input id="external-from" type="datetime-local" step="1" required/></label><label>结束时间（UTC，不含）<input id="external-to" type="datetime-local" step="1" required/></label><label>平台数据截至（UTC）<input id="external-observed" type="datetime-local" step="1" required/></label><label>来源说明<input id="external-source-label" type="text" minlength="3" maxlength="160" placeholder="例如：网易云创作者后台 · 导出批次" required/></label></div><label class="content-check report-attest"><input id="external-recognized" type="checkbox" required/>确认这是平台认可的数据，来源说明不含账号、访问令牌或私人链接。</label><div class="music-actions"><button id="external-submit" class="primary" type="submit"><Save size={17}/>保存平台记录</button><button id="external-new" type="button">新建另一条记录</button></div></fieldset></form></details>
<footer class="report-footer muted"><ExternalLink size={15}/>站内点击和平台播放分别核对。数据未提供时，始终显示“暂无数据”。</footer>
</main><script>import '../../../../scripts/adminStationReports.js';</script></body></html>
